      "content": "Archive — Windows in-app updates (#493), moved out of design/windows-updates.pen on 2026-09-19.\n\nThe shipped screens and cmp/UpdateDialog now live in design/runner.pen, in the WINDOWS band, built from cmp/WinTitlebar and the real sidebar and settings components. This file keeps the spec frames: hero states, sidebar update hint, dialog states and the flow note. Frame ids are unchanged."
